sequenceDiagram
    actor User as 用户
    participant Web as 前端 Web
    participant API as 网关 API
    participant DB as 数据库
    participant MQ as 消息队列

    User->>Web: 提交订单
    activate Web
    Web->>API: POST /api/orders
    activate API
    API->>DB: INSERT orders
    activate DB
    DB-->>API: order_id=1024
    deactivate DB
    API-)MQ: 发布 OrderCreated 事件
    API-->>Web: 201 Created
    deactivate API
    loop 每 500ms 轮询直到终态
        Web->>API: GET /api/orders/1024
        API-->>Web: status=pending
    end
    Web->>Web: 刷新本地缓存
    opt 用户勾选开票
        Web->>API: POST /api/invoices
        API-->>Web: invoice_no=INV-2024-1024
    end
    deactivate Web
    User->>Web: 显示下单成功
